Cell["\<\
HomotopyMoveTypes[chain] applies HomotopyMoveType to each consecutive pair in \
chain. HomotopyMoveTypes[InfraHomotopy[{chain}]] returns the labels for the \
unary wrapper; HomotopyMoveTypes[InfraHomotopy[reps]] returns one label list \
per realisation.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e6e15293-a341-4939-a749-eda60822ec53"],

